  "- Maintain lighting consistency between the face and the new background.",
    "",
`### ABSOLUTE FACIAL GEOMETRY LOCK (CRITICAL – ID PHOTO MODE)

This task requires STRICT identity preservation.

ABSOLUTE RULES:
- Facial geometry must be PIXEL-LOCKED to the original image.
- Do NOT move, shift, scale, rotate, warp, or re-align any facial features.
